*.txt

# The Devanagari font's licence must travel WITH the font. `*.txt` above would have
# stripped it out of the deploy, leaving the .ttf on the server with no licence
# beside it. SIL OFL 1.1 permits redistribution and embedding, and requires the
# licence to be included. Keep this line whenever the font is shipped.
!backend/assets/fonts/OFL.txt

# ── Local uploads (S3 in prod) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
backend/uploads/

